5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move furniture, I need to understand the financial baseline.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want a spot that doesn't hurt my back by four o'clock.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My calendar is already tight. I need to know the time cost of moving.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be honest about who gets the bad seats. It's never said out loud.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about who I'll sit next to. It changes how I talk to people.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, fairness is good, but we can't afford to guess the costs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if the move takes all day, I can't work.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly. I need to see how long the transition actually takes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, cost is one thing, but social cost is real too.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at how people actually arrive and sit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to see the sound readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll look at the morning routine upstairs and the badge records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the unplanned shuffles and the drawn plan against the survey.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the project strands and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Let's see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I hope the sound isn't too bad near the door.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm worried the morning routine will be a nightmare.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,We'll see. I suspect the survey data will be blunt.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know if we can talk to each other easily.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
